/Title (The Manifesto for Reproductive Justice is a call for the political organization of the fight for the sexual and reproductive rights of Black women. It is a political call, reaffirming the right of Black women and all people who gestate to live with dignity, autonomy, and pleasure, confronting racism, sexism, and inequalities that cross bodies and territories in different ways.)
